        "original_id": "51e7b3eb-7627-5ecf-ad29-1772e37d0792",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: VIVA Media GmbH, VIVA Media AG\n- Concepts: Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung, GmbH, GesmbH, S.à r.l.\n- Places: Germany, Austria, Switzerland, Liechtenstein\n\nFacts:\n- VIVA Media GmbH was called VIVA Media AG until 2004.\n- VIVA Media GmbH is a music television network originating from Germany.\n- A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung, abbreviated GmbH and also GesmbH in Austria, is a type of legal entity.\n- A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is very common in Germany, Austria, Switzerland, and Liechtenstein.\n- In Switzerland, a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is equivalent to a S.à r.l.",
